  "html": "<p>Repeatable quests are quests you can repeat time and time again.  Repeatable quests are often limited to killing a certain amount of enemies, or just finding certain amounts of items. Some of these quests are only repeatable while the player is within the level limits of the dungeon.\n</p>\n<table cellpadding=\"4px\" style=\"border: 1px solid gray; margin: 0px 15%;\">\n<tr>\n<td> <a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Exclamation.png\" title=\"Image:Exclamation.png\"><img alt=\"Image:Exclamation.png\" border=\"0\" height=\"100\" src=\"/images/recovered/Exclamation.png\" width=\"96\"/></a>\n</td><td>\n<p><b>INCOMPLETE!  This page is probably incomplete.  More information is needed.</b>\n</p><p>This page is developing and the information might be incomplete, and that's why we need <b>your</b> help to make this page as complete as possible!\n</p>\n</td></tr></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n\n<div id=\"mw-pages\">\n<h2>Articles in category \"Repeatable Quests\"</h2>\n<p>There are 66 articles in this category.\n</p><table width=\"100%\"><tr valign=\"top\"><td>\n<h3>A</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Afterparty\" title=\"Afterparty\">Afterparty</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Audit_Financial_Red_Tape\" title=\"Audit Financial Red Tape\">Audit Financial Red Tape</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Audit_Red_Tape_Under_Review\" title=\"Audit Red Tape Under Review\">Audit Red Tape Under Review</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Audit_Terra-Infirmary\" title=\"Audit Terra-Infirmary\">Audit Terra-Infirmary</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Audit_Vergrim's_Red_Tape\" title=\"Audit Vergrim's Red Tape\">Audit Vergrim's Red Tape</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Audit/_Vergrim's_Red_Tape_%282%29\" title=\"Audit: Vergrim's Red Tape (2)\">Audit: Vergrim's Red Tape (2)</a></li></ul>\n<h3>B</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Back_on_the_Wagon\" title=\"Back on the Wagon\">Back on the Wagon</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Back_to_the_Ol'_Fade_Factory\" title=\"Back to the Ol' Fade Factory\">Back to the Ol' Fade Fact